[01:17.32] As beasts we crawl
[01:26.64] Our souls in tatters
[01:37.11] Low to the dirt we scrape
[01:46.55] Degraded and hollowed
[01:59.62] Hollowed
[02:03.45] 
[02:39.37] Callous winds come ripping
[02:44.12] Every small light consumed
[02:48.84] Cower in rooms made coffins
[02:53.63] Quiver as to dust we turn
[03:03.03] To dust
[03:06.65] 
[05:56.52] Drift weightless without form
[06:01.45] Stilled in timeless air
[06:06.19] Hang eternal stars
[06:10.81] Coursing paths we cross
[06:16.49] In the lightening sky
[06:28.89] Fading
[06:33.29] 
[07:18.06] On frozen peaks
[07:27.34] First red rays earth from heavens sever
[07:36.70] All born, empty and silent
[07:45.25] From blind night torn
[07:48.02] New dawn unveiled
[07:55.99] 